WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
(Episode 6)

3
00:10.017 --> 00:14.873
The heads of the Koutokukai and the Kirii-gumi are mortal enemies.

4
00:14.898 --> 00:17.476
You said a war might break out the moment they cross paths...

5
00:18.877 --> 00:20.277
We're in deep trouble.

6
00:56.974 --> 00:58.600
Some things never change.

7
01:03.897 --> 01:06.697
Kei-chan, I missed you so much!

8
01:08.817 --> 01:10.117
Let's get married!

9
01:10.797 --> 01:12.434
Kei-chan!

10
01:12.517 --> 01:13.817
Whoa.

11
01:17.337 --> 01:18.637
I'll kill you.

12
01:19.557 --> 01:20.664
Kei-chan?

13
01:21.937 --> 01:23.234
I'm gonna kill you!

14
01:23.317 --> 01:24.617
Huh?

15
01:25.137 --> 01:26.437
This means all-out war!

16
01:28.417 --> 01:29.965
Come on, what war, Kei-chan?!

17
01:30.957 --> 01:32.257
Get off me!

18
01:33.218 --> 01:34.357
Wait up!

19
01:35.517 --> 01:37.617
Or how about a tank? Do you want a tank?

20
01:38.377 --> 01:40.034
You want a tank more than a whole city?

21
01:40.117 --> 01:41.614
Or do you want me?

22
01:41.697 --> 01:43.397
You're the last thing I need!

23
02:49.400 --> 02:51.385
"The Journey To Killing You Season 2"

24
03:17.322 --> 03:18.356
What's wrong?

25
03:43.056 --> 03:44.391
I thought that this time...

26
03:47.517 --> 03:49.137
I would protect you no matter what.

27
03:50.564 --> 03:51.564
Die!

28
04:00.637 --> 04:02.177
I still remember it.

29
04:22.017 --> 04:23.317
Kataoka-san.

30
04:24.765 --> 04:25.824
Kataoka-san!

31
04:28.518 --> 04:30.103
It hurts like hell...

32
04:46.328 --> 04:47.328
Kataoka-san.

33
04:48.580 --> 04:49.790
Kataoka-san!

34
04:59.317 --> 05:00.717
Right there in my arms,

35
05:03.417 --> 05:04.717
your warmth

36
05:05.917 --> 05:07.217
slowly faded away.

37
05:12.562 --> 05:13.980
Something like that...

38
05:14.917 --> 05:16.217
Never again...

39
05:24.577 --> 05:25.877
Asahi.

40
05:26.837 --> 05:28.137
Asahi.

41
05:30.700 --> 05:31.700
Asahi.

42
05:32.165 --> 05:33.165
Asahi.

43
05:34.251 --> 05:35.251
Asahi.

44
05:36.586 --> 05:37.587
Asahi!

45
05:52.018 --> 05:53.536
I'll protect you, Boss.

46
05:55.577 --> 05:56.877
I'll never...

47
05:57.777 --> 05:59.077
let you die.

48
06:17.586 --> 06:18.687
My old man...

49
06:20.317 --> 06:21.254
Not the former boss,

50
06:21.337 --> 06:22.637
my actual father.

51
06:25.077 --> 06:27.577
He died protecting the boss in a gang war.

52
06:30.432 --> 06:31.908
He left my mom behind.

53
06:33.018 --> 06:35.145
She wouldn't eat or sleep.

54
06:36.577 --> 06:38.214
She just cried all day long.

55
06:38.297 --> 06:39.597
She couldn't stop crying,

56
06:41.277 --> 06:42.817
and it completely broke her.

57
06:49.659 --> 06:51.553
When I stepped into the yakuza world,

58
06:52.597 --> 06:54.723
I swore I'd never settle down with a woman.

59
07:00.277 --> 07:01.917
That's why I married you.

60
07:05.617 --> 07:07.017
Because with you,

61
07:09.317 --> 07:11.317
whether we live or die, we're in it together.

62
07:16.686 --> 07:17.996
Boss...

63
07:19.517 --> 07:23.417
Though I really did mean it about taking responsibility for your first time.

64
07:27.077 --> 07:29.137
Do you really think you can be the only one saved?

65
07:29.697 --> 07:30.697
Huh?

66
07:32.869 --> 07:33.662
You'll never be happy.

67
07:33.745 --> 07:34.663
You don't get to be happy.

68
07:34.746 --> 07:35.746
Kill me.

69
07:36.748 --> 07:40.674
- You'll never be happy. - Please, kill me.

70
07:40.757 --> 07:42.838
You will never find happiness.

71
07:42.921 --> 07:44.174
Never be happy.

72
07:44.257 --> 07:45.382
Never.

73
07:46.277 --> 07:48.057
Never be happy.

74
07:53.097 --> 07:54.397
You will never

75
07:55.137 --> 07:57.334
find happiness.

76
07:57.417 --> 07:59.774
You'll never be happy.

77
07:59.857 --> 08:01.177
You don't deserve to be happy.

78
08:09.157 --> 08:10.157
Ren.

79
08:25.677 --> 08:26.856
Live on with me.

80
08:29.887 --> 08:30.969
Ren.

81
08:37.617 --> 08:38.917
Yes.

82
09:47.295 --> 09:48.313
This is taking up space.

83
09:49.457 --> 09:50.523
Take it back.

84
09:53.497 --> 09:54.797
This money is...

85
09:57.797 --> 09:59.224
There's 200 million here.

86
09:59.307 --> 10:00.600
I'm leaving the family.

87
10:02.237 --> 10:03.637
It's all yours.

88
10:07.557 --> 10:10.757
With the tribute owed to headquarters, the Kirii-gumi must be strapped for cash.

89
10:11.217 --> 10:12.617
You didn't touch this money?

90
10:13.370 --> 10:14.670
Well...

91
10:17.897 --> 10:19.197
Who knows?

92
10:27.657 --> 10:28.554
Come on, stay a little longer.

93
10:28.637 --> 10:30.338
No way, I'm heading back to Okinawa.

94
10:30.421 --> 10:31.673
Are you really leaving?

95
10:31.756 --> 10:32.614
Yeah, for real this time.

96
10:32.697 --> 10:33.394
I'm gonna miss you.

97
10:33.477 --> 10:35.594
What's with you? Is that all you know how to say?

98
10:35.677 --> 10:36.394
Boss.

99
10:36.477 --> 10:36.994
Huh?

100
10:37.077 --> 10:38.014
We're gonna miss you so much.

101
10:38.097 --> 10:39.397
Yeah, right.

102
10:40.677 --> 10:42.134
Alright boys, time to go.

103
10:42.217 --> 10:44.717
Don't go, Boss!

104
10:45.537 --> 10:46.954
Sorry to keep you waiting.

105
10:47.037 --> 10:49.014
Oh, all wrapped up?

106
10:49.097 --> 10:50.397
Yes.

107
10:51.377 --> 10:52.677
Ren-Ren!

108
10:53.897 --> 10:55.113
I'll stan you for the rest of my life!

109
10:55.137 --> 10:57.037
I'll drop champagne tips on your stream!

110
11:01.161 --> 11:02.328
Kataoka-san.

111
11:04.622 --> 11:05.748
Thank you for everything.

112
11:06.497 --> 11:07.667
Sure.

113
11:07.750 --> 11:09.043
Take care of yourself.

114
11:09.917 --> 11:11.217
Yes, sir.

115
11:16.037 --> 11:17.337
Boss.

116
11:24.309 --> 11:25.602
Fourth.

117
11:27.337 --> 11:28.894
Hit me up if you ever come to Okinawa.

118
11:28.977 --> 11:31.017
I'll hook you up with double boba in your milk tea.

119
11:31.524 --> 11:33.068
Give me a break.

120
11:33.151 --> 11:34.627
I hate the heat.

121
11:52.879 --> 11:55.315
Still as impossible to read as ever.

122
11:57.177 --> 11:58.477
The Fourth...

123
11:59.137 --> 12:01.454
is actually pretty easy to read.

124
12:01.537 --> 12:02.837
Him?

125
12:04.017 --> 12:06.517
You must be pretty weird yourself to say something like that.

126
12:12.857 --> 12:14.157
Kataoka-san.

127
12:17.177 --> 12:18.637
There's somewhere I want to go.

128
12:30.297 --> 12:31.543
Whoa! A fish just jumped!

129
12:31.626 --> 12:32.474
It's a fish!

130
12:32.557 --> 12:34.545
Odajima, did you see that? A fish!

131
12:41.357 --> 12:42.657
I missed it.

132
12:51.137 --> 12:52.737
It'd been a while since I played yakuza.

133
12:53.857 --> 12:55.157
That was actually pretty fun.

134
13:01.155 --> 13:02.448
Back to civilian life now,

135
13:05.523 --> 13:06.619
right?

136
13:07.829 --> 13:08.829
Ren.

137
13:13.117 --> 13:14.417
Yes.

138
13:15.897 --> 13:17.414
Kataoka-san.

139
13:17.497 --> 13:19.074
That was your cue to call me Kin-chan.

140
13:19.157 --> 13:20.457
Read the room, man.

141
13:24.617 --> 13:25.917
Whenever that guy...

142
13:27.377 --> 13:29.237
talked about you,

143
13:30.537 --> 13:33.771
he always called you Kataoka-san.

144
13:37.857 --> 13:39.514
Odajima.

145
13:39.597 --> 13:40.897
It's Kataoka-san.

146
13:42.177 --> 13:43.648
He's seriously so cool.

147
13:44.557 --> 13:45.557
You know,

148
13:46.277 --> 13:49.557
someday I'm gonna make it big and rake in the cash, just like Kataoka-san.

149
13:52.157 --> 13:53.677
And then I'll build...

150
13:54.377 --> 13:56.397
a huge, fancy house for my mom.

151
13:57.183 --> 13:58.623
Man...

152
13:59.363 --> 14:01.983
I can't wait to show it to Kataoka-san.

153
14:19.270 --> 14:22.796
[TN: Asahi Kaiho's grave with his religious "given" name on it]

154
14:33.623 --> 14:35.016
Sorry to keep you waiting.

155
14:38.617 --> 14:40.077
Let's go build that big house,

156
14:41.422 --> 14:42.465
Asahi.

157
14:45.635 --> 14:47.904
He really meant a lot to you, didn't he?

158
14:50.857 --> 14:51.949
Yes.

159
14:53.518 --> 14:54.852
More than anyone.

160
15:01.597 --> 15:02.897
I see.

161
15:17.177 --> 15:18.477
So there really are...

162
15:21.838 --> 15:23.773
three of us in this family.

163
15:54.620 --> 15:56.206
Kataoka-san.

164
15:56.289 --> 15:57.289
Hmm?

165
15:58.397 --> 15:59.874
Someday,

166
15:59.957 --> 16:01.257
would it be okay if I told you?

167
16:02.477 --> 16:03.777
Everything about me.

168
16:05.297 --> 16:06.299
Sure.

169
16:06.917 --> 16:08.377
Whenever you're ready to talk,

170
16:09.577 --> 16:11.337
we've got all the time in the world.

171
16:12.457 --> 16:14.277
Until we're both old and gray,

172
16:16.017 --> 16:17.017
right?

173
16:20.337 --> 16:21.737
Come to think of it,

174
16:22.937 --> 16:24.337
on our very first trip together,

175
16:26.037 --> 16:29.271
you were actually trying to kill me, weren't you?

176
16:33.137 --> 16:35.337
I don't know how many decades it'll take,

177
16:36.897 --> 16:38.617
but if you stick with me till the very end,

178
16:42.877 --> 16:44.757
you'll get to watch me die with your own eyes.

179
17:00.497 --> 17:02.277
That's going to be a long wait.

180
17:03.857 --> 17:06.057
Which means we get to be together that much longer.

181
17:13.157 --> 17:15.937
Oh, right. You still haven't kissed me first.

182
17:18.016 --> 17:19.316
You still remember that?

183
17:20.097 --> 17:21.397
Of course I do.

184
18:07.253 --> 18:08.421
Kataoka-san.

185
18:09.417 --> 18:10.590
That's too long.

186
18:12.517 --> 18:14.174
What if someone sees us...

187
18:14.257 --> 18:15.934
Who cares?

188
18:16.017 --> 18:17.317
We're married.

189
18:24.417 --> 18:25.772
Kataoka-san.

190
18:25.855 --> 18:26.855
Hmm?

191
18:40.177 --> 18:41.987
Where did this money come from?

192
18:42.913 --> 18:43.913
Uh...

193
18:45.077 --> 18:46.794
Did you sneak this out of the bag?

194
18:46.877 --> 18:48.957
I blew all my horse racing winnings.

195
18:50.703 --> 18:51.703
What?

196
18:53.317 --> 18:54.214
Oh?

197
18:54.297 --> 18:55.074
Hand it over!

198
18:55.157 --> 18:56.457
No way!

199
18:57.157 --> 18:58.457
Not happening!

200
22:05.577 --> 22:06.877
Man...

201
22:07.657 --> 22:09.537
I can't believe it went under.

202
22:10.517 --> 22:12.037
The old man's shop.

203
22:12.677 --> 22:13.677
Yeah.

204
22:14.542 --> 22:16.268
That really caught me off guard.

205
22:17.257 --> 22:18.257
Yes.

206
22:19.217 --> 22:21.815
Looks like the old man is stepping down as boss, too.

207
22:23.057 --> 22:24.057
Yes.

208
22:25.997 --> 22:27.297
Hey, wait a second.

209
22:28.597 --> 22:30.897
Have you been saying nothing but "yes" this whole time?

210
22:32.557 --> 22:33.557
Yes.

211
22:34.937 --> 22:38.094
Seriously, what are we supposed to do now?

212
22:38.177 --> 22:40.401
Even our place belongs to the old man.

213
22:40.484 --> 22:42.570
Just like that, we're both jobless and homeless.

214
22:45.737 --> 22:47.197
Should we go back to being yakuza?

215
22:48.857 --> 22:49.857
Huh?

216
22:50.397 --> 22:51.697
Just kidding.

217
22:53.577 --> 22:55.794
Your jokes never sound like jokes at all.

218
22:55.877 --> 22:57.177
Honestly, they're terrible.

219
22:58.117 --> 22:59.417
My bad.

220
23:04.117 --> 23:05.717
No matter what happens, we'll be fine.

221
23:06.337 --> 23:07.344
Huh?

222
23:09.057 --> 23:10.394
Because we...

223
23:10.477 --> 23:11.777
are free.

224
23:14.137 --> 23:15.437
You're right about that.

225
23:28.677 --> 23:29.754
Where to now?

226
23:29.837 --> 23:31.174
I'm starving.

227
23:31.257 --> 23:32.754
Let's go grab some sushi.

228
23:32.837 --> 23:34.137
We're broke, remember?

229
23:40.557 --> 23:41.587
If...

230
23:42.377 --> 23:43.937
there's really such a thing as forever,

231
23:45.057 --> 23:46.775
then it's this journey to killing you.

232
24:21.117 --> 24:23.157
(The End)
